{"version":1,"content":"<p>新華社報道，副大軍區職退休幹部、原總裝備部科學技術委員會副主任汪致遠，因病醫治無效，於10月2日在北京逝世，享年85歲。</p><p>汪致遠是已故大陸海協會會長汪道涵長子。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T12:21:09.800808+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":80,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T12:05:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T16:18:18.702251+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T12:18:12.804739+00:00","content_hash":"10da7e66f439ff8098f29631f6397daf92dc14be3b1cfa680a3a5639fbf528fb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}